              <li>How did the API help to quickly add more functionality to your program?</li>
              <li>How did you use the API? What rules or structure of the API did you follow to show the correct images? </li>
            </ol>

        </statement>
        <response/>
      </activity>
</subsection>

    <subsection xml:id="LOs-3-3">
    <title>Learning Objectives Review</title>

    <remark>
      <title>3.3.A</title>
      <p>
        Develop code using appropriate libraries or existing code segments to create a program.
      </p>
    </remark>
  </subsection>

  <subsection xml:id="vocab-3-3">
   <title>Vocabulary Review</title>

     <activity label="vocab-libraries">
      <statement>
        <p>
          Review the vocabulary in this lesson. Drag the vocabulary term from the left and drop it
          on its correct definition on the right.
          Click the "Check Me" button to see if you are correct.
        </p>
      </statement>

